<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 105 0 R
/T (Addressing this compounded challenge requires targeted policy interventions to convert idle human capital into economic output. Governments must modernize education by prioritizing vocational and digital training while partnering with private firms for mandatory apprenticeships. To unlock the private sector, policymakers should establish state-backed credit guarantees and simplify registration for youth-led enterprises. Finally, strategic investments must focus on localized agribusiness processing and digital infrastructure while leveraging the African Continental Free Trade Area to help young entrepreneurs scale across borders. Turning this population wave into an economic driver remains a critical macroeconomic priority.)
/E (Addressing this compounded challenge requires targeted policy interventions to convert idle human capital into economic output. Governments must modernize education by prioritizing vocational and digital training while partnering with private firms for mandatory apprenticeships. To unlock the private sector, policymakers should establish state-backed credit guarantees and simplify registration for youth-led enterprises. Finally, strategic investments must focus on localized agribusiness processing and digital infrastructure while leveraging the African Continental Free Trade Area to help young entrepreneurs scale across borders. Turning this population wave into an economic driver remains a critical macroeconomic priority.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
