/Next 1182 0 R
>>
endobj
1167 0 obj
<<
/Title (At the same time, weak institutions and limited accountability created opportunities for corruption to grow. In some cases, public resources were misused, political positions were used for personal or political gain, and citizens had little power to hold leaders accountable. Although Africa has made major progress since independence, the effects of some of these historical challenges can still be seen in the political and economic situations of certain countries today.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1147 0 R
/Prev 1182 0 R
>>
endobj
