1180 0 obj
<<
/Title (The effects of these issues go beyond politics. When governments are unstable or public resources are not properly managed, ordinary citizens can be affected through limited access to quality education, healthcare, infrastructure, jobs, and other essential services. Corruption can also reduce trust in government and increase inequality, while political instability can make it even harder for institutions to function effectively.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1146 0 R
/Prev 1164 0 R
/Next 1165 0 R
>>
endobj
