<<
/Title (Political instability deepens when leaders manipulate constitutions to consolidate power and extend term limits. By weakening judicial independence, silencing media, and marginalizing opposition parties, ruling elites orchestrate "silent coups" that destroy democratic checks and balances. This subversion of constitutional order erodes public faith in legal institutions, restricts civic freedom, and increasingly leaves popular uprisings or military intervention as the only avenues for political change.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1209 0 R
>>
